---
title: "create_authenticated_price_infos_using_accumulator (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_check_source: is_valid_data_source(pyth_state, vaa_source)
    q_check_source --> q_abort: false, abort E_INVALID_DATA_SOURCE
    q_check_source --> q_parse: true
    q_parse --> q_decode: cursor = cursor::new(accumulator_message)
    q_decode --> q_verify: price_infos = accumulator::parse_and_verify(cursor, vaa_payload, clock)
    q_verify --> q_destroy_cursor: cursor::destroy_empty(cursor)
    q_destroy_cursor --> [*]: return hot_potato_vector::new(price_infos)

    note right of q_destroy_cursor
        INV-001: cursor must be fully consumed (destroy_empty aborts if not)
        INV-002: returned HotPotatoVector must be consumed in same transaction
        INV-003: VAA must originate from a valid data source
    end note
